OL,4,BFormula 1's one-race wonders           
OL,5,GYou've been handed the chance of a     
OL,6,Glifetime.                              
OL,8,FA chance to sit in the cockpit, on the 
OL,9,Fgrid, at motorsport's top table:       
OL,10,FFormula 1. The very pinnacle of        
OL,11,Feverything you've strived for in your  
OL,12,Fwhole life.                            
OL,14,FWhat would you do?                     
OL,16,F"I sang the Grand Prix theme tune      
OL,17,Fwhile I was sat on the grid. I thought 
OL,18,FI was watching it on telly," says Tiff 
OL,19,FNeedell - one of 166 lucky or unlucky  
OL,20,Fdrivers, depending on your standing in 
OL,21,Fmotorsport, who graced an F1 race only 
OL,22,Fonce.                                  
